        "This article is an outlook as of September 2026, not a promise of a particular growth rate. Cloudflare's [2025 Radar review](https://blog.cloudflare.com/radar-2025-year-in-review/) reported a strong rise in user-action crawling on its network and large, variable crawl-to-refer ratios by platform. Those figures cover Cloudflare-observed traffic, not every site or industry. They give a reason to measure your own baseline, not a conversion forecast for a new domain."
